@startuml
title Reportes y Exportación
actor Administrador
participant "Frontend Reportes" as UI
participant ReportController
participant ReportService
participant Repositories
database MySQL

Administrador -> UI : Aplica filtros
UI -> ReportController : GET /reports/{type}
ReportController -> ReportService : build(type, filters)
ReportService -> Repositories : Consultas reales
Repositories -> MySQL : orders/products/categories
ReportService --> UI : Tabla y resumen

Administrador -> UI : Exportar XLSX/PDF
UI -> ReportController : GET /reports/{type}/xlsx o pdf
ReportController -> ReportService : exportar
ReportService --> UI : Archivo descargable
@enduml
